msgstr "Batterie de diagnostics"

#: app/templates/diag_battery/index.html
msgid "The commands Diagnose Log Collection runs on the devices of this ADOM. Candidates come from a discovery walk of a real device; every command is checked against the read-only battery rules when it is saved and again when it runs."
